<title>USA: Hastings sets reg qtly div, extra div $0.05.</title>
<headline>Hastings sets reg qtly div, extra div $0.05.</headline>
<dateline>HASTINGS, Mich. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hastings Manufacturing Co said Wednesday it had declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.10 per share and an extra dividend of $0.05 per share, both payable September 15, record Agust 28.</p>
<p>The company said this is the first extra dividend it has issued since the third quarter of 1991.</p>
</text>
